  "Of course, let's find a table.": "content/audio/of-course-let-s-find-a-table-85b30bf6.m4a",
  "I'm in a hurry.": "content/audio/i-m-in-a-hurry-7d6747d3.m4a",
  "My parents worked very hard here. They didn't speak much English at first, but they learned, little by little.": "content/audio/my-parents-worked-very-hard-here-they-di-3185382a.m4a",
  "That sounds so hard.": "content/audio/that-sounds-so-hard-5c821ad7.m4a",
  "That sounds easy.": "content/audio/that-sounds-easy-b5a9baa9.m4a",
  "It was hard, yes. But we had good neighbors. They helped us a lot.": "content/audio/it-was-hard-yes-but-we-had-good-neighbor-aabc4be0.m4a",
  "I'm glad you weren't alone.": "content/audio/i-m-glad-you-weren-t-alone-521ee433.m4a",
  "That's not surprising.": "content/audio/that-s-not-surprising-f1bcc17f.m4a",
  "Thank you for listening. There's more, but I think my brother remembers it better than I do.": "content/audio/thank-you-for-listening-there-s-more-but-ebcdc209.m4a",
  "Can we go talk to him?": "content/audio/can-we-go-talk-to-him-4852d7e7.m4a",
