  "Sure, let's go home.": "content/audio/sure-let-s-go-home-bf5b5911.m4a",
  "Not yet, five more minutes.": "content/audio/not-yet-five-more-minutes-8e42f7f4.m4a",
  "I hope that clipping helped.": "content/audio/i-hope-that-clipping-helped-589cc366.m4a",
  "It helped so much. Thank you.": "content/audio/it-helped-so-much-thank-you-a1c13596.m4a",
  "Anytime. Come back if you need more.": "content/audio/anytime-come-back-if-you-need-more-871dc305.m4a",
  "I will, thank you again.": "content/audio/i-will-thank-you-again-d6ae3d39.m4a",
