  "Thank you for coming with me today.": "content/audio/thank-you-for-coming-with-me-today-e5459a25.m4a",
  "Of course, I wanted to come.": "content/audio/of-course-i-wanted-to-come-e34dc542.m4a",
  "It's not a big deal.": "content/audio/it-s-not-a-big-deal-5aa2c657.m4a",
  "Are you nervous? I am, a little.": "content/audio/are-you-nervous-i-am-a-little-3cf694b9.m4a",
